  "title": "Keto Stuffed Pepper Casserole",
  "description": "Love stuffed peppers but hate the grain? Try this low-carb, keto-friendly makeover casserole with riced cauliflower, tomatoes, and Cheddar.",
  "authors": [
    "Lauren Stathas"
  ],
